WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.375
The sky was gray.

2
00:00:03.376 --> 00:00:07.177
A strong wind blew.

3
00:00:07.178 --> 00:00:17.245
Eddy drove across the parking lot.

4
00:00:17.246 --> 00:00:20.221
"Hi, Eddy," said Dipper.

5
00:00:20.222 --> 00:00:25.977
"Want to play tag?"

6
00:00:25.978 --> 00:00:29.632
"No, thanks," said Eddy.

7
00:00:29.633 --> 00:00:32.905
"I'm busy."

8
00:00:32.906 --> 00:00:34.701
Honk! Honk!

9
00:00:34.702 --> 00:00:37.615
Poppy zoomed over to Eddy.

10
00:00:37.616 --> 00:00:44.426
"Hey, Eddy!" she said.

11
00:00:44.427 --> 00:00:47.224
"Want to hear a joke?"

12
00:00:47.225 --> 00:00:51.515
"Not right now," said Eddy.

13
00:00:51.516 --> 00:00:55.626
"I have something to do."

14
00:00:55.627 --> 00:00:58.204
Eddy drove past Jeb.

15
00:00:58.205 --> 00:01:00.056
Jeb was digging.

16
00:01:00.057 --> 00:01:03.436
"Hi, Eddy," said Jeb.

17
00:01:03.437 --> 00:01:06.257
"Want to play in the dirt?"

18
00:01:06.258 --> 00:01:09.232
"Not now," said Eddy.

19
00:01:09.233 --> 00:01:13.665
"I'm busy."

20
00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:16.606
Eddy drove onto the racetrack.

21
00:01:16.607 --> 00:01:20.768
The racetrack was empty.

22
00:01:20.769 --> 00:01:29.657
It was smooth.

23
00:01:29.658 --> 00:01:33.918
"I'm alone," said Eddy.

24
00:01:33.919 --> 00:01:38.220
"Now I can practice racing!"

25
00:01:38.221 --> 00:01:41.781
"Hey, slowpoke!" said a voice.

26
00:01:41.782 --> 00:01:47.103
Eddy groaned.

27
00:01:47.104 --> 00:01:57.663
It was Zippy.

